sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant DocQ as RMQ ingest.documents
  participant DocW as ingest-worker-doc
  participant ChunkQ as RMQ ingest.chunks
  participant ChunkW as ingest-worker-chunk
  participant OLM as Ollama embeddings
  participant QDR as Qdrant

  User->>GW: POST /ingest (base64 PDF)
  GW->>DocQ: publish DocumentMessage
  GW-->>User: 202 Accepted {doc_id}
  DocQ-->>DocW: deliver
  DocW->>DocW: parse (pypdf) + chunk_text (recursive)
  loop por chunk (~800 tokens, overlap 120)
    DocW->>ChunkQ: publish ChunkMessage
  end
  DocW-->>DocQ: ack
  par N consumidores em paralelo
    ChunkQ-->>ChunkW: deliver
    ChunkW->>OLM: POST /api/embeddings (nomic-embed-text)
    OLM-->>ChunkW: vetor 768d
    ChunkW->>QDR: upsert (point_id=sha256(chunk_id), vector, payload)
    ChunkW-->>ChunkQ: ack
  end
